        title: 'How does Workout Quest work?',
        description: 'Workout Quest gamifies your fitness and exercise experience by making it simple and fun to track your workouts: At it\'s core, it allows you to track your workout as you train (or schedule it ahead of time) by picking exercises from a large database and entering information about your reps, sets and weights. When completing workouts, you gain experience, level up, earn achievements and are provided with insights to help you stay on track.',
